# Skills that ship in this pack

This index lists the skills in `skills/`. Matt Pocock skills and Addy Osmani skills are installed by `/setup-pm51stack` in the pm51stack plugin. When to use those, read `../plugins/pm51stack/skills/setup-pm51stack/decision-graph.md`. The runnable workflow is `plugins/pm51stack`.

| Task | Skill | Key rules |
|------|-------|-----------|
| Backend API, handlers, services, domain | `go-backend` | architecture, go-style-guide |
| REST and HTTP endpoint design | `rest-api-design` | architecture, go-style-guide, authentication-security |
| Schema changes, migrations | `database-migrations` | database-migrations |
| React components, frontend UI | `frontend-react` | frontend-patterns |
| Writing or fixing tests | `testing` | go-testing-practices, frontend-testing-practices, e2e-testing-standards, testing-agent |
| TDD cycle | `tdd-workflow` | test-driven-development |
| Commit messages and pull-request titles | `conventional-commits` | agent-behavior |
| Stage and create git commits | `git-commit` | conventional-commits, agent-behavior |
| Install Matt Pocock skills, Addy Osmani skills, and point at pstack | `/setup-pm51stack` in the pm51stack plugin | `plugins/pm51stack/skills/setup-pm51stack/SKILL.md` |
| Run the development workflow (plugin) | `/pm51-mode` in the pm51stack plugin | `plugins/pm51stack/skills/pm51-mode/SKILL.md` |

Skills in this pack are in `../skills/<name>/SKILL.md`. That path is relative to `rules/`. At the repository root the same files are `skills/<name>/SKILL.md`. `/setup-pm51stack` and `/pm51-mode` are commands in the pm51stack plugin.

## How to use

1. Find the task in the table.
2. Read that skill.
3. Follow the rules the table names.

For planning, debugging, review, and launch, run `/setup-pm51stack`, then use `../plugins/pm51stack/skills/setup-pm51stack/decision-graph.md`.

